# Next 16's agentRules: true (next.config.mjs) regenerates these on every
# `next dev`/`next build` — Next's own generated framework/route-convention
# notes for AI agents, not this project's real CLAUDE.md (repo root).
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Synced/uploaded media — re-downloadable via `pnpm sync:moysklad`, not source.
# Anchored to this file's own directory (leading /) — an unanchored `media/`
# also matched src/app/(admin)/admin/media/ (Stage 3 page group 6), silently
# dropping that route's actions.ts/page.tsx from `git status` entirely.
/media/
